cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use biocohort in your work, please cite it as below.
title: "biocohort: Cohort Objects for Subjects and Samples in Omics Studies"
abstract: >-
  An R package that keeps the subjects, samples, and analysis outputs of a
  study in one validated object, for any organism and any omics assay, with
  a long-format sample manifest, pipeline sample sheets, an analysis
  registry, and pluggable cross-species translation backends.
type: software
